    <div>
      <p class="who-p">founder and B2B growth partner behind <strong>Ascent</strong>, which has worked with 20+ businesses including SalesCoachPro, LaunchPoint Lab, App Marketing Assassins, GlassHouse and ClearCycle Partners.</p>
      <p class="who-p">also built <strong>WealthOS</strong> solo from scratch, got it into Microsoft for Startups, and is a full stack developer. <strong>official Anthropic CPN member.</strong></p>
